Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.00,0:04:48.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《电锯惊魂2》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.10,0:01:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.30,0:01:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.60,0:01:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.52,0:02:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.52,0:02:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想和你玩个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止，在你所谓的一生里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, in what could loosely be called your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.19,0:02:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直通过窥探他人而谋生\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've made a living watching others.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,社会上称你为告密者、小人和小贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Society would call you an informant, a rat, a snitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.27,0:02:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说你配不上自己的躯体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call you unworthy of the body you possess,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.14,0:02:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,和被赋予的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the life that you've been given.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.01,0:02:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，让我们看看你是否愿意注重内心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we will see if you are willing to look inward.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.65,0:02:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是外表\N{\fnArial\fs30}rather than outward,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.08,0:02:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃你依赖的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}to give up the one thing you rely on in order to go on living.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.99,0:02:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脖子上的装置叫做死亡面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}The device around your neck is a death mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.59,0:02:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,它由弹簧控制器控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mask is on a spring timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.56,0:02:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不能及时找到钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do not locate the key in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.26,0:02:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,面具就会关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}the mask will close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.13,0:02:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以把它想象成捕蝇草一样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of it like a Venus flytrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.64,0:02:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在看到的是不到2小时前\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you are looking at right now is your own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你自己的身体 - 哦，妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- not more than two hours ago. - Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 你睡着了什么感觉都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. You're sound asleep and can't feel a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑到你如今处于完全的劣势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking into account that you are at a great disadvantage here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会提示你钥匙被藏在哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going to give you a hint as to where I've hidden the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.55,0:03:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.99,0:03:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,提示就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hint is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.16,0:03:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就在你眼睛前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right before your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克，为了生存你要流多少血？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much blood will you shed to stay alive, Michael?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.07,0:03:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,生还是死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.20,0:03:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的到底是谁？ 你他妈的到底是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the fuck are you? Who the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.10,0:03:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的到底是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.87,0:03:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.30,0:03:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,来人救救我啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.85,0:04:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.75,0:04:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,照做！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.68,0:04:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.87,0:04:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck! What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.73,0:04:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.44,0:04:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不，不，不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打扰了 - 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. - Help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.24,0:05:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来找丹尼·马修的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here for Daniel Matthews.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.28,0:05:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这签名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sign these.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.82,0:05:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，我们走，丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Let's go, Daniel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.66,0:05:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来得够晚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took you long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.13,0:05:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉没把这事记在日程上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I didn't have it penciled in on my schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.90,0:05:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道他们会控告你的 - 对啊，他们都是混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're gonna press charges, you know. - Yeah. They're assholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.80,0:05:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了，你偷了他们的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course they are. You stole from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我倒是不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This works out great for me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.94,0:05:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈得以保留监护权 我却能把你关进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother gets to keep custody. I get to take you into custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.15,0:05:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.75,0:05:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在能偷，就算是条硬汉了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you a tough guy 'cause you steal now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托，少来点课外辅导了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, save me the after-school special.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么总要扮成个警察的样子？ - 嘿，这是作你父亲的义务\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are you such a cop 24l7? - Hey, it's called being a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.32,0:05:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说，你还是当个警察好些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, you're better at being a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.19,0:06:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想该早点回到我妈那儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just think I should go back to Mom's early.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.16,0:06:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？ - 怎么，听不见么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you say? - What, can you not hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.23,0:06:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没听见 你再给我说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't hear you. Say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.43,0:06:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想该早点回到我妈那儿去了… - 好，你滚啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think I should go back to Mom's… - Well, then, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.27,0:06:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.25,0:06:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，这是丹尼，请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's Daniel. Leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.59,0:06:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是老爸，昨天的事我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Dad. Sorry about yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.16,0:06:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，你一直没音讯 能给我回个电话么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I haven't heard from you. Would you give me a call, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.64,0:06:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daniel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.34,0:06:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，警官 我以为是我儿子打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry, Sarge. I thought you were my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.18,0:06:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我马上到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.45,0:06:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:07:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,县里的石棉清理工正在赶工\N{\fnArial\fs30}County asbestos cleaners were working on a deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.39,0:07:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们其中一个发现了这具尸体 就报告给我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them finds a body, calls it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.46,0:07:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说这个区域已经被废弃2年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says that this whole section's been abandoned for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.46,0:07:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这下面还是有人出没\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've spotted people down here, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.13,0:07:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？ - 大部分都是无家可归者\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - Well, homeless, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.43,0:07:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有小孩说2个月前听到锅炉房有惨叫声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bunch of kids held a rave in the boiler room about two months back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.63,0:07:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 死亡时间明确了么？ - 法医刚来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get an estimate on the time of death? - Forensics just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.70,0:07:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有警官辨认出死者是你朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was the arriving officer who called it in as your buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.51,0:07:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是，他是我的一个线人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't my buddy. He was an informant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.54,0:07:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只凭看，这位警官就能确认他的身份？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This officer IDed him just by looking at him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是很肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he wasn't positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.78,0:07:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以我们才叫你过来 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's why I wanted you here. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.08,0:07:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我瞧瞧他的脸 2秒钟就能认出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let me get a look at his face. I'll tell you in two seconds if it's him or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.89,0:07:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therein lies the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.31,0:07:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，是麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.63,0:08:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算什么时候告诉我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When were you gonna tell me about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你想亲自看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you'd wanna see it for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Well, I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.37,0:08:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承认这样断言有点早，但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look. I mean, it's a little early,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止，一切都和“竖锯”的手法吻合\N{\fnArial\fs30}but so far everything matches Jigsaw's pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.21,0:08:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白，那你叫我干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see that. What do you want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.71,0:08:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们暂时假装没有这方面的经验，好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's just pretend for a second that this is new to us, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.91,0:08:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能想出来谁要对你的人下手么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you think of anyone that would wanna do this to your guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯丽，他是个线人 你想要嫌疑犯名单是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's an informant, Kerry. You want a list of possible suspects?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.35,0:08:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个电话本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab a phone book.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.78,0:08:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,小混混们又没有工程学位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crackhead county punks don't have engineering degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.42,0:08:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，我说让我们从杀人动机来想 把嫌疑人减少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'd say that our cause of death here narrows that list down just a little bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.22,0:08:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,行不行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.19,0:08:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了，你是专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. And you're the expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,马修侦探，走近点看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look closer, Detective Matthews.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.70,0:08:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}At what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.71,0:09:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己去问写了这句话的人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask whoever wrote it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.09,0:09:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想和你玩个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.16,0:09:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止，在你所谓的一生里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, in what could loosely be called your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.46,0:09:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直通过窥探他人而谋生\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've made a living watching others.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.73,0:09:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯丽，你知道你和那家伙有很多相似点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you and that guy have a lot in common, Kerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦，是么？ - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.24,0:09:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都喜欢耍别人玩 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You both like playing games with people. - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次在犯罪现场别和我闹着玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever pull some shit like that again on me at a crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.48,0:09:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着，不是我要吓你，是他 - 那也不意味着我要上钩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, I'm not the one taunting you. He is. - Doesn't mean I have to take the bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.48,0:09:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 此外，我手上有一堆案子要办 - 不就是些文书之类的狗屁工作么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Besides, I got a full caseload as it is. - A bunch of desk errands and shit work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.89,0:09:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，还有催工的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, between that, IA breathing down my neck,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.99,0:09:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那不学好的儿子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}my son's budding criminal career.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.29,0:09:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我老婆的离婚律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my wife's fucking divorce lawyers,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.82,0:09:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说我是忙死了，不是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say my hands are pretty full, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.36,0:09:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Look, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.69,0:09:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望，或许 这案子我们可以一起办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping, maybe, that I could bring you in on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:09:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯丽，我们不再是拍档了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not partners anymore, Kerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.67,0:10:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我们不是拍档，但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, forget that we're not partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.93,0:10:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙把你的名字写在墙上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the fact that this guy wrote your fucking name on the wall, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.70,0:10:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要找的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.84,0:10:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有神经病找我也不是第一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the first time some psychopath called me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.07,0:10:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，算我求你的怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. What about the fact that I'm asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.68,0:10:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱莫能助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.45,0:10:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wow。- 你才是“竖锯”案的专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow. - You're the Jigsaw expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.59,0:10:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候不想干警察了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you stop being a cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.26,0:10:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,马修侦探，走近点看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look closer, Detective Matthews.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.23,0:10:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙把你的名字写在墙上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy wrote your fucking name on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.47,0:10:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,马修侦探，走近点看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look closer, Detective Matthews.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.85,0:10:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要找的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.51,0:10:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，伙计们听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, fellas. Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.88,0:10:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是最佳进入点\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the best entry points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们通大马路，有车道和良好的掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the ones with direct street frontage, vehicle access and good cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.99,0:11:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在记住… 我们在大白天干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, remember, we're doing this in broad daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.46,0:11:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想惊吓到市民\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't wanna scare any civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.90,0:11:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前来过，了解地形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I've been there before. I know the location.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.76,0:11:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接冲进去 不管是谁在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just bust in there and scare the shit out of anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.90,0:11:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,都吓他一跳，明白了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}who happens to be inside, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.20,0:11:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,3人1组进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going in teams of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.24,0:11:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和阿尔法队一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with Team Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.05,0:11:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像过去的好日子，是不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like the good old days, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.02,0:11:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你很忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought your caseload was big enough as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.69,0:11:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是随队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just tagging along for the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.16,0:11:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，快，快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.54,0:11:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯好后面，注意后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the back. Secure the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.14,0:11:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开工 - 上，上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go around. - I got it, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.91,0:11:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔法队先上 二组，包围这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha Team, I want you in front. Baker, flank the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.95,0:11:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，大伙上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.38,0:12:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,上，上，上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.69,0:12:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进，前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving, keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.38,0:12:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.85,0:13:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.43,0:13:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人受伤！有人受伤！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer down! Officer down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.46,0:13:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这鬼地方有人监控\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fucking place is wired!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.93,0:13:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有警官受伤，有警官受伤！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer down! Officer down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.50,0:13:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的，二组，快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck this! Baker Team, get in here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.57,0:13:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快去 - 二组，快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, go, go! Go! - Baker Team, get in now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.38,0:13:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.75,0:13:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计，回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.06,0:13:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他抬出去，抬出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer down. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.97,0:13:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,后援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.23,0:13:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抬出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move him out. Move him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.97,0:13:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,无障碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear. Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.37,0:13:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,后援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.84,0:14:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.71,0:14:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.82,0:14:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住，不许动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze! Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.02,0:14:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手拿出来 我不会再说第二遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see your hands. I'm not gonna ask again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.63,0:14:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手放在我能看见的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands where I can see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.09,0:14:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down on your knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.56,0:14:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跪下！ - 恐怕我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Down on your knees! - I'm afraid I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.48,0:14:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他绑起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him in restraints now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有权保持沉默，你有权请律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the right to remain silent. You have the right to an attorney.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.96,0:14:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你付不起… 市政府会给你指定一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can't afford one, one will be appointed to you by the City.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.56,0:14:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他身上没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.60,0:15:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这足够近了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this close enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.38,0:15:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他弄出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get his ass out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.05,0:15:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上，我得呆在这…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I will need to remain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.45,0:15:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你忙于处理自己的麻烦的时候 马修侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}while you deal with your problem, Detective Matthews.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.76,0:15:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么麻烦？ - 那间房里的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What problem? - The problem in that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.47,0:15:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep him secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.44,0:16:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有可疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.43,0:16:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.83,0:16:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.17,0:16:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.44,0:16:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想那是我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.11,0:16:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.08,0:16:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他抓住了我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.02,0:17:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他妈的是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.66,0:17:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，嘿，那他妈的是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey! What the fuck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.93,0:17:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你儿子丹尼，你还记得他吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your son, Daniel. You remember him, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了，你这坨大便渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who he is, you piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.50,0:17:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么会跑到他妈的屏幕上去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he doing on that fucking monitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.17,0:17:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好久没看那显示器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I haven't looked at the monitors for some time,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.47,0:17:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it would be hard for me to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.17,0:17:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可以想象 他肯定害怕得躲在角落里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I would imagine that he's cowering in a corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.81,0:17:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧他的脸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a look on his face…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.11,0:17:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你个贱人 - 不，埃里克，等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You motherfucker! - No, Eric. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个贱人！ 他在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You motherfucker! Where is he? Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.51,0:17:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.71,0:17:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪这个问题要你来解决 在一切都太迟了以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a problem you're gonna have to solve before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.75,0:17:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他大约还有2小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has about two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.45,0:17:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,此后毒气就会损伤他的神经系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the gas creeping into his nervous system.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.95,0:17:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏他的身体组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}begins to break down his body tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.16,0:17:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会七窍流血而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he begins to bleed from every orifice he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.29,0:17:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，没错，会是鲜血淋漓的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. There will be blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.47,0:17:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.14,0:17:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in a safe place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.62,0:18:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃里克 - 我要电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eric. - I need a phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.05,0:18:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃里克，听我说一句 - 把电话给我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eric, just listen to me for a second. - Just give me a phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.56,0:18:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着，这一切都符合他的特点 - 我要确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, everything about this fits his profile. - I need to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.67,0:18:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打通的是丹尼的电话 他现在不在，你可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've reached Daniel's phone. He's not in right now, but if you'd leave…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.91,0:18:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.47,0:18:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有东西在倒计时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have something counting down over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.01,0:18:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,把排弹组派来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me bomb squad, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.33,0:18:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.83,0:18:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.77,0:18:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.24,0:19:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,能听见我说话么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.48,0:19:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还有气\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.72,0:19:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么意思，家庭软禁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this, house arrest?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.05,0:19:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在监狱么？ - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we in jail? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.12,0:19:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伙计，这不是监狱 - 是么，你蹲了很久监狱么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This ain't jail, man. - Oh, yeah? You done a lot of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.79,0:19:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.50,0:19:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来人把他妈的门打开 - 我不认为有人在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Somebody open the fucking door! - I don't think anybody's listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的到底是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn. What the fuck is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.44,0:19:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在监听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.27,0:19:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.08,0:19:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种监视器没有声音的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those types of cameras don't have sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.15,0:19:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,操！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.45,0:19:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我操！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.79,0:19:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会醒来却躺在一个不认识的地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you just wake up in a room and have no idea where you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.89,0:19:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,估计你从来没醉过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you never been drunk before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.49,0:19:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然醉过了 我上了3年大学呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been drunk. I spent three years at college drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.53,0:19:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,醉…这不是醉酒 这是绑架\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't drunk. This is kidnapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.17,0:20:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧，我上周在电视里看了一部电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I saw this movie on TV last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.97,0:20:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个家伙，是个记者 他要去战区采访\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy, he was a reporter, and he goes into this war zone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.14,0:20:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,头天晚上他在酒店里睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He goes in to sleep in his hotel room the first night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.28,0:20:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘭！他第二天醒来 却在一个没有窗户也没有灯的监狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bam! He wakes up the next morning, he's in a cell with no windows and no light.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.08,0:20:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那一呆就是9年\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he spent nine years in that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,9年？ 伙计，那算不了什么，别想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine years? Man, that's nothing. Get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.69,0:20:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想了是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "get over it"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.03,0:20:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说叫你别闲扯了，找点事做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, stop bitching about it and let's do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.99,0:20:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我认为我们都该冷静 - 闭嘴！闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think we should all just calm down. - Shut up! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.10,0:20:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.81,0:20:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘀嗒声，我听到嘀嗒声了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ticking. I hear ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.99,0:21:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，嘿，冷静，冷静 你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey. Calm down. Calm down. What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.90,0:21:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在哪儿？ - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where am I? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.07,0:21:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道，我们都和你一样刚醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody knows. We all just woke up here like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.74,0:21:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.11,0:21:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.65,0:21:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不！ - 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.28,0:21:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.65,0:21:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.42,0:21:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.53,0:21:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在找什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.69,0:22:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.66,0:22:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要知道的一切都在这上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you need to know is on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.36,0:22:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好，欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greetings and welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.93,0:22:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你们一定想知道这是什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust that you are all wondering where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.27,0:22:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你们保证 你们所在的位置并不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can assure you that while your location is not important,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.04,0:22:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的是这几面墙能给你们提供的\N{\fnArial\fs30}what these walls offer for you is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.34,0:22:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果可以的话，救赎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salvation, if you earn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.51,0:22:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,3个小时后，这座房子的门会打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hours from now, the door to this house will open.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.48,0:22:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是，你们只有2小时好活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, you only have two hours to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.99,0:22:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，你们正在呼吸着致命的毒气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, you are breathing in a deadly nerve agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.99,0:22:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,从到这儿以后就开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been breathing it since you arrived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.96,0:22:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,熟悉东京地铁毒气事件的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those of you familiar with the Tokyo subway attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.96,0:22:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该知道它对人体的巨大伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}will know its devastating effects on the human body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.67,0:22:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们唯一抵抗它并活着走出去的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way to overcome it and walk out that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.24,0:22:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是找到解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to find an antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.51,0:22:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们被藏在房子的各处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Several are hidden around this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.81,0:23:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个就在你们面前的保险柜里\N{\fnArial\fs30}One is inside the safe in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.95,0:23:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都有保险柜的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all possess the combination to the safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.72,0:23:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细想想 数字就在你们思想的后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think hard. The numbers are in the back of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.89,0:23:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样排列它们的线索位于彩虹的彼端\N{\fnArial\fs30}The clue to their order can be found over the rainbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.69,0:23:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你们发现了自身的共同点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you realize what you all have in common,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.66,0:23:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就会更清楚自己为什么会在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will gain a better understanding of why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.70,0:23:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,「X」标记了线索出现的地方 仔细地找\N{\fnArial\fs30}"X" marks the spot for that clue, so look carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.74,0:23:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏开始！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the game begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.71,0:23:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是谁？ - 他说的气体是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is this? - What does he mean, gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.58,0:23:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么会找这东西的？ - 都是扯谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And how did you know where to find this? - This is bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.62,0:23:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,“不要尝试用这把钥匙打开房门”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Do not attempt to use this key on the door to this room".
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.59,0:23:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck this, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.59,0:23:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错，去他妈的，这主意不错 - 不，不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, fuck this. That's a good idea. - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.33,0:23:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那不是个好主意 - 那我们怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not a good idea. - So what are we gonna do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.00,0:23:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坐在这儿？ - 纸条上说不要用钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sit here? - The note said not to use the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.70,0:23:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,管它的纸条呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who gives a shit about the note, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.73,0:23:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是一个天大的玩笑 而且我要结束它\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all a fucking big goddamn joke, and I'm about to end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.46,0:24:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好现在开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better start talking right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.26,0:24:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？ - 一场游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is this? - It's a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.26,0:24:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才不是什么他妈的游戏 有人刚被打中了脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't no fucking game! My man just got his head blown off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.26,0:24:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在考验我们 - 谁在考验我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's testing us. - Who's testing us?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.83,0:24:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,“竖锯”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jigsaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.90,0:24:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- “竖锯”到底是谁？ - 你没看过新闻么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who the hell is Jigsaw? - You don't watch the fucking news?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.61,0:24:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有，他是谁？ - 一个连环杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. Who is he? - He's a serial killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.88,0:24:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，他不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.28,0:24:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在考验我们 他希望我们能活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's testing us. He wants us to survive this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.11,0:24:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们要按照规则来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have to play by the fucking rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.82,0:24:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再问你一次，你怎么知道的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna ask you again. How do you know all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.46,0:24:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我以前玩过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I've played before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.38,0:25:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在叫一个技术支持组过来 查出信号源在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a tech team in here now. Find out where that feed is coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.63,0:25:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.86,0:25:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的一点时间，侦探 - 我没时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A little of your time, Detective. - I don't have any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.07,0:25:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问我要什么，我告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked me what I wanted, and I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.74,0:25:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我说的，你儿子麻烦大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me when I tell you your son is in a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.98,0:25:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我抽出点时间怎样，怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what if I give you a little bit of my time? What then?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.55,0:25:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想和你谈，其他人都要离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only wanna talk to you. Everyone else must leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.08,0:25:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我的条件 - 不，这是犯罪现场，谁都不能走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Those are my conditions. - No. It's a crime scene. Nobody leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.32,0:25:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不需要离开这幢楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't have to leave the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.75,0:25:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要离开这个区域就好 足够我和你谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just have to leave this area long enough for me to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.59,0:26:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你同意，马上就能见到你儿子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you agree to that, then you will see your son again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.63,0:26:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我再也见不到我儿子了，我对天发誓 我会把你的头扭下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't see my son again, I swear to God I'll rip your fucking head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.50,0:26:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官，不是我笑你 我是一名癌症患者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't intend to mock you, Officer, but I'm a cancer patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.67,0:26:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又怎么能把我置于 比现在更大的痛苦中呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you possibly put me in any more pain than I'm already in?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.45,0:26:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在把他们叫来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get them here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.55,0:26:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，技术组正在赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, tech team's on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.99,0:26:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,1到2小时就能查出信号来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should have your signal traced within an hour, maybe two.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.12,0:26:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说要单独和我谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he wants to talk to me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.62,0:26:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能你是需要和他谈谈 - 去他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, maybe you should talk to him. - Well, fuck that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.63,0:26:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,5分钟，老办法搞定他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes, old-school method.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.06,0:26:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他对“电话本疗法”没什么反应的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna respond to the phone-book treatment. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.50,0:26:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别小看一个久经考验的好办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't underestimate a tried and true method here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.03,0:26:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直跟进这案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the one who has been working on this case from day one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.97,0:26:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要睁着眼就在想着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been spending every waking moment piecing it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.37,0:26:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能就因为这个你到现在还没成家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's why you ain't got a goddamn family for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.64,0:26:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且也不明白埃里克所受痛苦的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can't understand what this man is going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.25,0:26:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 瞧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't. - Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.85,0:26:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想和他谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.45,0:27:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，因为和我扯上关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you already lost your son one time before.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.62,0:27:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经失去儿子一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you got involved with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.72,0:27:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事不会再发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.36,0:27:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,放屁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.83,0:27:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.13,0:27:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,迎合他，争取时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just humor him. Buy us a little more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.03,0:27:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以赢的，埃里克 我们能击败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can win this, Eric. You can beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.54,0:27:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧！ - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.38,0:27:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,…找到解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}…find an antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.48,0:27:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们被藏在房子的各处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Several are hidden around this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.61,0:27:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个就在你们面前的保险柜里\N{\fnArial\fs30}One is inside the safe in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.95,0:27:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都有保险柜的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all possess the combination to the safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.49,0:27:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细想想 数字就在你们思想的后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think hard. The numbers are in the back of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.86,0:27:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细想想 数字就在你们思想的后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think hard. The numbers are in the back of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.00,0:27:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样排列它们的线索位于…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The clue to their order can be found…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.65,0:28:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.53,0:28:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，等一下，你要上哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait a minute. Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.80,0:28:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找到解药，活着出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna find an antidote, and I'm gonna get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.43,0:28:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么解药？你蹲过大牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Antidote? You been in the joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.34,0:28:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,和狱卒聊过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talked to the guards that run the chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.24,0:29:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道根本没有什么狗屁解药的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know there ain't no antidote for this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.31,0:29:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧，门没上锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this. The doors are locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.71,0:29:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到没有？木头做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that? It's wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.48,0:29:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且，伙计，这不是什么碉堡 只是他妈的一个房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plaster. It's not a fortress. It's a fucking house.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.88,0:29:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要说的就是慢慢来 想出一个策略\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I'm saying is let's just take our time and come up with a game plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.52,0:29:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，你来想策略 行了吧？我自己出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you come up with the game plan. All right? I'm getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.60,0:29:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.42,0:29:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？ - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.07,0:30:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是你，我不会那么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't do that if I was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.21,0:30:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道那门后面是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what's behind that fucking door.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.09,0:30:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.52,0:30:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.00,0:30:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.51,0:30:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，我们来谈啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.88,0:30:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下，埃里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down, Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.49,0:31:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想做个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.43,0:31:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,规则很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rules are simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.03,0:31:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要做的就是坐在这里和我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to do is sit here and talk to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.50,0:31:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.70,0:31:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果时间到了… 你会发现你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do that long enough, then you will find your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.21,0:31:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a safe and secure state.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.54,0:31:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没正式介绍呢 我叫约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't been properly introduced. My name's John.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.65,0:31:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为你喜欢被称为“竖锯” - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought you liked to be called Jigsaw. - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.32,0:31:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是警察和媒体起了“竖锯”这个别名\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the police and the press who coined the nickname Jigsaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.69,0:31:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不那样自称\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never encouraged or claimed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.06,0:31:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从实验对象身上砍下来的锯渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}The jigsaw piece I cut from my subjects was only ever meant to be a symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.73,0:31:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是作为一个象征\N{\fnArial\fs30}that that subject was missing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.06,0:31:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,象征他缺少了一项谜样的人类重要组成部分 生存本能\N{\fnArial\fs30}A vital piece of the human puzzle. The survival instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.13,0:31:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真的很有趣，约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all really, really interesting, John,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.94,0:31:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在我非常希望你能和我谈谈…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but right now I'd really like for you to talk to me…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.17,0:31:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在和你谈啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.64,0:31:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.41,0:31:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别忘了规则 - 我在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't forget the rules. - I'm listening to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.55,0:32:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我现在耳朵里充斥的却是一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}but all I'm hearing is the same sick fucking bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.22,0:32:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次我调查你们这些变态狂2秒钟之内\N{\fnArial\fs30}that comes about two seconds into every interview I've ever done.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.86,0:32:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能听到的胡言乱语\N{\fnArial\fs30}with one of you fucking people.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.42,0:32:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你采用的真是个不错的侦破手法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's an interesting approach to police work, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.56,0:32:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是应该装成我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you supposed to be convincing me that I'm your friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.63,0:32:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一种错误的安全感 来骗取我的信任么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}lulling me into a false sense of security so that I'll confide in you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.54,0:32:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在要我按手册办事很难 因为我儿子在你手上，约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little hard to follow the manual when you've got my son, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.91,0:32:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,手册？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The manual?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.18,0:32:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在想对我做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you really wanna do to me right now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.88,0:32:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你5年前做了些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you have done five years ago, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.75,0:32:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时按照手册办事了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you have followed the manual then?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.02,0:32:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是要用手电把我下巴打下来么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you have broken my jaw with a flashlight?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.32,0:32:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像很了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem to know a whole lot about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.72,0:32:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你以前被认为是一名无畏的警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you were once considered a fearless police officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.03,0:32:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在坐对面是不是感觉安全多了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you feel a whole lot safer now that you only sit behind a desk?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.10,0:32:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在感慨万千\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel a whole lot of things right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.50,0:32:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道自己还活着，就是这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you feel alive. That's what you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.94,0:32:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,才是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.48,0:32:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.45,0:33:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好心地帮我拿杯水过来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}kindly get me a glass of water?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.75,0:33:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would very much appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.85,0:33:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.25,0:33:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们明白蛮干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we've established.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.49,0:33:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是打不开那扇门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the macho-bullshit approach isn't opening the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.86,0:33:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么好主意么？ - 看看是谁在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any other suggestions? - Look who's talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.13,0:33:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你唯一会开的门就是你双腿中间的那扇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only door you know how to open is between your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.40,0:33:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你他妈的给我闭嘴，好吗？ - 别这样，伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why don't you shut the hell up, all right? - Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.47,0:33:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你给我闭嘴 - 我听够了你的废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why don't you shut the hell up? - I'm sick of your bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.47,0:33:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了，退后，贱人 - 你个阳痿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's right, back up, bitch! - You little dickhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.50,0:33:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 混球！ - 喂！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Asshole! - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.57,0:34:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想干嘛？ 好了，够了，退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you gonna do? Yeah, yeah, that's right, back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.91,0:34:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，不要窝里斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, man. All right. Nobody take shit from nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.64,0:34:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说好了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've established that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.82,0:34:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有发现么？ - 没，没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you find anything? - No. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.43,0:34:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手臂上的印记… 是在朱丽叶监狱服刑的标志吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that ink on your arm, that's Joliet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.17,0:34:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. So?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.00,0:34:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也在那儿蹲过 - 很骄傲么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I did a stretch there myself. - I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.77,0:34:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢，是在哪儿改造的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, what is your correctional facility of choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.28,0:34:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.44,0:34:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是你那一套 不是从研究生院学来的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}My point is, you didn't get that way by teaching grade school, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.65,0:34:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我们就有3个人曾经进过监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes three of us that's done time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.82,0:34:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我们应该集中考虑那卷磁带\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should be concentrating on that tape,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.75,0:34:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为上面说我们有很多 不为人知的共同点\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause that tape said we have more in common than we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.06,0:34:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说我们3个进过监狱的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say the three of us doing stretches…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.63,0:34:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！这儿有扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! I found a door over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.91,0:35:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我手电\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.45,0:35:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.79,0:35:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.57,0:36:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.14,0:36:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.81,0:36:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死，小子 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn, kid. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.45,0:36:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- “欧比” - 欧比是他妈的什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Obi". - What the fuck is a Obi?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.56,0:36:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比，是我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obi. It's my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.00,0:36:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，欧比 我想和你玩个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Obi. I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.57,0:36:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年来，你一直\N{\fnArial\fs30}For years, you have burned those around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.31,0:36:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,欺骗自己周围的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your lies, cons and deceits.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.78,0:36:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你有机会赎回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you'll have a chance to redeem yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.92,0:36:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你玩弄他人的罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the games you've played with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.28,0:37:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过参加我的这个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}by playing one of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.79,0:37:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你面前的仪器里有2剂解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside the device in front of you are two antidotes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.22,0:37:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以解除你们体内的毒素\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the poison coursing through your veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.43,0:37:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中1个是作为我谢谢你 帮我绑架其他人的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}One is my gift to you for helping me kidnap the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.26,0:37:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,另1个需要你送给他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second is yours to donate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.03,0:37:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，要拿到它们中的1个是要付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, one of them will come with a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.04,0:37:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住，欧比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, Obi,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.24,0:37:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你身处地域 能救出你的便只有魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}once you are in hell, only the devil can help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.94,0:37:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 “绑架其他人”是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. What does that mean, "kidnap the others"?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.41,0:37:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我怎么知道？ - 因为是你把我们抓进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How would I know? - Because you put us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.02,0:37:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽车里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.06,0:37:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.73,0:37:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道我见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.67,0:37:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我在这醒来前见到的最后1个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the last person I saw before I woke up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.07,0:37:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.28,0:38:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定是他么？你最好搞清楚点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure it's him? You better be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.08,0:38:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.65,0:38:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我你也会这么做的 我是被逼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would have done the same. I did what I had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.95,0:38:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.79,0:38:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你现在有5秒钟告诉我们怎么出去 - 我不知道出去的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got five seconds to get us out of here. - I don't know the way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.69,0:38:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说！你把我们关进来的 也就能把我们弄出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit! You put us in here. You can get us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.80,0:38:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.43,0:38:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你死定了 - 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then you're a dead man. - So are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.27,0:38:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行，等等，等等 等等，听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna… Wait, wait, wait, wait! Wait, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.57,0:38:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在炉子后面有2管解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we got two antidotes at the back of that oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.94,0:38:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在浪费时间 - 浪费时间？你开玩笑吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're wasting time here. - Wasting time? Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.88,0:38:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他在半夜里绑架了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kidnapped me in the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.55,0:38:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道管道里有什么陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know what's in those syringes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.62,0:38:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意伸手进去试试么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You willing to stick yourself in the arm to find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.19,0:38:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，好的，等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, wait. So who gets them?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.76,0:38:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说，哪2个人可以用它们来解毒呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, there's two. So which two people get the antidote?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.19,0:38:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个等会再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll work that out later!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.50,0:38:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，你要么进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now you're going in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.07,0:38:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么我就地把你宰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'll kill you where you stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.81,0:39:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.18,0:39:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要想拿刀子来要挟我 最好还是动点真格的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're gonna threaten me with a knife, you may as well cut me a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.29,0:39:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会去拿那些解药的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'm going in there to get those needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.06,0:39:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要用掉其中的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I get one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.26,0:40:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的一份 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One for me. - Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.87,0:40:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来，宝贝 你们可以抢这一只了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby. You guys can fight over this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.31,0:40:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，欧比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Obi.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.74,0:40:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.95,0:40:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦，糟糕，他妈的门关上了 - 开门！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shit. The fucking door closed! - Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.02,0:40:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.79,0:40:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁上了，我打不开\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's locked. I can't open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.82,0:40:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.33,0:40:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开这该死的门！这可不好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the fucking door! Not funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.16,0:40:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，把他弄出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Get him out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.10,0:40:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,门\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.63,0:40:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,被钉上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nail!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.60,0:40:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打不开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get it open!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.07,0:40:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把他救出来 - 这可不好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get him out of there! - Not funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.70,0:41:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,用外套 用你他妈的外套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use your coat! Use your fucking coat!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.34,0:41:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快，他快烧死了 - 不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! He's burning up! - Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.92,0:41:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 - 转过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Turn! Turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.28,0:41:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.65,0:41:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用力啊 - 不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You gotta put your weight on it. - Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.32,0:41:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他快要死了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My man's dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.56,0:41:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们，那边有扇窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, there's a window over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.86,0:41:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他拿到解药了 - 不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's got the antidote. - Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.03,0:41:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他弄出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.73,0:41:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快！ - 打开它！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry! - Get it open.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.30,0:41:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 操！- …是玻璃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck! - …glass or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.04,0:41:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要！ - 坚持，伙计，我们会把你救出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop it! - Hang on, man. We're gonna get you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.21,0:41:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.61,0:41:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要，不要了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it! Stop it! Stop it! Stop it! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.78,0:42:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开！快他妈的闪开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the fucking way! Go on, move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.79,0:42:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了！快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Shit! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.56,0:42:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,针管呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The needles!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.66,0:42:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿到针管了 他妈的本来在那的呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't got the fucking needles! It's fucking in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.39,0:42:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要他妈的针管 我要他妈的针管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the fucking needles! I want the fucking needles!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.50,0:42:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.03,0:42:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈的 - 针管都化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck! - The needles are fucking melted.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.27,0:42:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.07,0:42:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.88,0:43:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯丽，又死了1个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another one down, Kerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.18,0:43:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还要在这混蛋身上浪费多少时间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much more time are we gonna waste on this bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.05,0:43:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.15,0:43:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在做我们该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing exactly what we should be doing until the tech team gets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.99,0:43:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what it looks like to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.16,0:43:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看，侦探，达尔文的进化论\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Detective, Darwin's theory of evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.83,0:43:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,和适者生存那一套 是从他访问加拉帕戈斯那次旅行中得来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and survival of the fittest, based on his little trip to the Gal醦agos,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.16,0:43:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这个星球已经不再适用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}no longer applies on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.90,0:43:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类已经没有优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a human race that doesn't have the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.57,0:43:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,和意愿生存下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the will to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.97,0:43:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你他妈的想要什么？ - 现在想保持冷静很难，不是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the fuck do you want? - It's hard to remain calm, isn't it,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.17,0:43:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你儿子在那些屏幕里走来走去的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when your son is walking around on those monitors?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.41,0:43:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能满足你的需要 除非你告诉我到底想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't give you what you want if you don't tell me what the fuck it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.98,0:43:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.71,0:43:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 记住规则就好了 - 不，你说你想谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just remember the rules. - No, you said you wanted to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.92,0:43:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你又说想做个游戏 你在说，但全是些废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you said you wanted to play a game. You're talking, but it means nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.26,0:43:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃里克，你说什么东西能治好癌症？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think the cure for cancer is, Eric?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.33,0:43:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 癌症的解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - The cure for cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.63,0:43:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是什么？ - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - I don't know what it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.10,0:43:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道肯定不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I know it's not killing and torturing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.27,0:43:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了自己变态的快感而虐杀别人 都是他们自己选的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your own sick fucking pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.87,0:43:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的一生中从未谋杀过任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never murdered anyone in my life. The decisions are up to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.84,0:44:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，用枪指着别人的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, putting a gun to someone's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.44,0:44:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼着他们自己扣下扳机也该算作谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}and forcing them to pull the trigger is still murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.54,0:44:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾几何时，暴力成为你的问题了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when is force a problem for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.55,0:44:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么想要回你的儿子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you so desperate to get your son back?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.52,0:44:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他是我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause he's my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.49,0:44:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你离开他之前说过的最后一句话是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the last thing you said to him before you left him?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.26,0:44:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，你滚吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.70,0:44:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来儿子垂死挣扎的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems to me that the knowledge of your son's impending death is causing you to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.53,0:44:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,触动到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive all his sins, to wipe the slate clean…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.07,0:44:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么只有在性命攸关的时候 我们才想起这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it that we're only willing to do that when a life is at stake?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.41,0:44:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直爱儿子，这从来没变过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always loved my son. That's never changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.71,0:44:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不，现在变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. It's changed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.88,0:44:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说，得知死讯能改变一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, the knowledge of death changes everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.18,0:44:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我告诉你死亡的具体时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were to tell you the exact date and time of your own death,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.95,0:44:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会彻底颠覆你的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would shatter your world completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.22,0:44:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.23,0:44:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能想象到么？ 有人叫你坐下来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you imagine what it feels like to have someone sit you down…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.60,0:45:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·克莱姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Kramer.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.30,0:45:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,…然后告诉你死期将至\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and tell you that you're dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.97,0:45:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种悲痛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gravity of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.04,0:45:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,钟滴滴答答地走着\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the clock's ticking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.45,0:45:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那一秒，你的世界就象裂开了个大缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a split second, your world is cracked open.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.22,0:45:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看问题，感觉事情的角度都变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look at things differently. You smell things differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.22,0:45:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你珍惜一切，不管是一杯水 还是一次公园里的散步\N{\fnArial\fs30}You savor everything, be it a glass of water or a walk in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.33,0:45:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰，时间在流逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}The clock is ticking, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.30,0:45:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但大多数人都很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}But most people have the luxury.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.56,0:45:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不知道钟什么时候会停\N{\fnArial\fs30}of not knowing when that clock's gonna go off,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.83,0:45:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,讽刺的是，因为这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the irony of it is that that keeps them from really living their life.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.30,0:45:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不能好好地活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It keeps them sleepwalking.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.20,0:45:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们喝水 却从来不感受它的甘甜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It keeps them drinking that glass of water, but never really tasting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.01,0:45:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰，你还能救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can still fix this, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.68,0:45:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能救的了你么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but can we fix you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.28,0:45:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.45,0:45:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not fixable.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.85,0:45:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得了癌症\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.46,0:46:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把癌症当成犯罪的借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're using cancer as an excuse for what you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.03,0:46:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.07,0:46:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是癌症让我走上这条路的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cancer isn't what started me in my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.20,0:46:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算结束自己生命的那一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the moment I decided to end my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.01,0:46:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,才是我行动的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}that started me in my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.21,0:46:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且使我的生命有了意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}and brought meaning to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.58,0:46:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我操！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.65,0:46:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经想自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had literally driven myself to suicide,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.82,0:46:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I had failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.79,0:46:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的身体抵挡不住癌细胞的攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}My body had not been strong enough to repel cancer cells,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.69,0:46:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我却大难不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet I had lived through a plunge off a cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.43,0:46:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇迹般的，我活下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, to my amazement, I was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.47,0:46:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我决心把剩余的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was determined to spend the rest of my days.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.21,0:46:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,花在研究人类本性上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}testing the fabric of human nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.12,0:47:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白么，埃里克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand, Eric?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.89,0:47:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰，乘你现在还有机会 做点什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a chance to do something. Do it right now, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.32,0:47:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我儿子的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me where my son is.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.26,0:47:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.53,0:47:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要你帮… 而且我知道你现在还不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need your help, and I can tell you still don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.70,0:47:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不珍惜生命的人，不配拥有它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those who don't appreciate life do not deserve life.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.84,0:47:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子珍惜自己的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son appreciates his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.14,0:47:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你珍惜自己的么？ 你珍惜你儿子的么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do you appreciate yours? Do you appreciate your son's?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.58,0:47:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，你到底在胡扯什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.65,0:47:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.42,0:47:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想找到儿子的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you wanna find your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.55,0:47:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.36,0:47:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不，我们没有15分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, we don't have 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.93,0:47:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要信号源的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need that location to the video feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.61,0:48:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，我不认为该放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I don't think we should stop, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.55,0:48:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂，能听见我说话么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laura, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.09,0:48:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这鬼地方已经是第2次醒来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the second time I've had to wake up in this shithole.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.76,0:48:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还能站起来么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you can stand up?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.36,0:48:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以，但我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I don't really want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.60,0:48:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那么多事没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's so much left to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.33,0:48:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么多人没说过话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many people left to talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.81,0:48:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会就这样死了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.21,0:48:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.62,0:48:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿曼达，你说你成功脱险过？ - 我什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amanda, you said you survived this, right? - I what?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.56,0:48:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙，不管他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy, whoever's doing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.86,0:48:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你和他玩过 而且活下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you said that you've played before and you survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.87,0:48:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.80,0:48:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那意味着我们也能活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that means we could survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.94,0:49:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.11,0:49:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达，他为什么选你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Amanda, why did he pick you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.78,0:49:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我吸毒上瘾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I was a fucking junkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.82,0:49:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣的是… 我通过了他的考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the funny thing is, I passed his little test.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.16,0:49:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你已经通过了，那怎么现在又回来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you passed his test, then why are you back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.40,0:49:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我虐待自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't being very good to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.38,0:49:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你什么时候开始吸毒的？ - 从监狱里开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long have you… - I started in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.95,0:49:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么被抓？ - 藏毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What were you arrested for? - Possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.25,0:49:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我以为你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I thought you said that…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.02,0:49:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能你该去问问逮捕我的警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should talk to the cop who arrested me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.73,0:50:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你从没被逮捕过吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing you've never been arrested before.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.70,0:50:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.67,0:50:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，我的意思是 我也惹过不少麻烦，三分钟热度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I've been in trouble a few times, you know, in and out of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.50,0:50:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的爸爸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad's a…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.34,0:50:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可真不是好惹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a real hardass.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.18,0:50:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在可能派全城半数的人在找我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he's probably got half the city right now looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.52,0:50:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后因为我的失踪而海扁我一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}just so he can kick my ass for disappearing on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.79,0:50:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.62,0:50:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.40,0:50:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现了一扇门，过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found a door. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.50,0:50:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.24,0:50:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一一扇没上锁的 但我们打不开\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only one without a lock, but we can't get it open.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.89,0:51:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 卡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's it going? - It's stuck on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.56,0:51:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.47,0:51:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来，让我试试，让开，让开 - 你放松点好吗？老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here, let me try. Move, move! Come on. - Will you take it easy? Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.87,0:51:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吵了，好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just back up, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.15,0:51:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果打不开，肯定是个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's stuck, it's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.69,0:51:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士，整个屋子就是个大陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady, this whole house is a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.59,0:51:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然，有些人不想我们进这间屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously someone didn't want us to get into this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.56,0:52:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在怎么办？ - 我马上就回来，好么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now what? - I'm gonna be right back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.46,0:52:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么，我们3分钟之内都要完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever we do, we got four minutes to get it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.49,0:52:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，泽维 我想和你做个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Xavier. I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.86,0:52:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个游戏…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game I want to play is very similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.29,0:52:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你作为毒贩子玩的那个非常相似\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the one that you've been playing as a drug dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.63,0:52:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个把希望卖给绝望中的人的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game of offering hope to the desperate for a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.84,0:52:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们都同意你现在的处境很绝望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we can agree that your situation is desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.71,0:52:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我把希望卖给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I offer you hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.67,0:53:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的条件就是 要你进入你逼顾客们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The price you pay is that you must crawl into the same pit of squalor.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.48,0:53:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入的肮脏的陷阱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}you force your customers into.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.55,0:53:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在你们进来时… - 我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- By entering this room… - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.35,0:53:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,…计时器便已启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a timer has been started.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.25,0:53:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时以后 你们面前的那扇门就会永远被锁上\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the timer expires, the door in front of you will be locked forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.12,0:53:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …在那以前 - 各位？各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Only in finding the key… - Guys? Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.19,0:53:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.63,0:53:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能不能把它打开…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the timer runs out can you unlock it…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.66,0:53:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 并拿出里面的解药？ - 老天爷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and retrieve the antidote inside. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.20,0:53:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于钥匙的位置我只给你们一个提示…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will give you just one hint as to where that key is.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.98,0:53:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,大海捞针\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be like finding a needle in a haystack.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.98,0:53:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the game begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.32,0:53:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,得有人下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's going in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.79,0:53:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧，现在得有人下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look, somebody's fucking going in there, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.49,0:53:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.70,0:53:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我靠 - 你要干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shit. - What the fuck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.43,0:53:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 住手！ - 你要干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop. - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.47,0:53:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不！不！ - 你他妈的在干什么！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! No! - What the fuck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.17,0:53:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不！不要！求你了 - 放她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! No! Please! - Let her go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.27,0:54:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.94,0:54:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.25,0:54:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.55,0:54:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.42,0:54:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们没时间了 - 我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't have time! - Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.59,0:54:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈犯什么病了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.23,0:54:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.26,0:54:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你他妈的疯了 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're out of your fucking mind. - Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.27,0:54:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.90,0:54:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.27,0:54:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.48,0:54:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快他妈找啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep fucking looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.18,0:54:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点，快点 - 去你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! Come on! - Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.59,0:54:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.40,0:55:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,来人帮帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's gotta help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.01,0:55:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了，大伙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.71,0:55:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,操！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.43,0:55:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.20,0:55:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.01,0:55:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.98,0:55:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.88,0:55:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不，不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.17,0:56:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这婊子！ - 好了，够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You fucking bitch! - All right. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.74,0:56:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not nearly enough, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.07,0:56:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,少废话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop this bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.41,0:56:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没听见那带子么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that tape?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.35,0:56:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道我们我们的…名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows about us. Our names.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.49,0:56:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定是漏掉了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something that we're not seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.52,0:56:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.83,0:56:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你们3个蹲过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you three had been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.33,0:56:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是4个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it four.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.23,0:56:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么进去的？ - 无关紧要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For what? - Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.07,0:56:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么人要坦白么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody else wanna own up?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.57,0:56:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？是不是进过少管所？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you? You got juvie written all over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.18,0:56:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, never been.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.48,0:56:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.25,0:57:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们谈谈 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's talk this out. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.85,0:57:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.65,0:57:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们唯一的共同点就是 拖我的后腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing you people have in common is holding me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.96,0:57:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.75,0:57:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 技术组跑哪儿去了？ - 就快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is this goddamn tech team? - They'll be here any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.58,0:57:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not listening to this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.28,0:57:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 简直是度日如年 - 听着，我了解这家伙的手法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Another second is too fucking long. - Look, I know how this guy works, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.36,0:57:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在玩游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's playing a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.79,0:57:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃里克只要多坚持一会就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric just needs to stay in it a little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.93,0:57:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look at the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.70,0:57:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该用点发散思维了 否则他儿子肯定要挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to start thinking outside the box, or his son is gonna end up in one.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.07,0:57:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的杰作\N{\fnArial\fs30}His work.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.94,0:58:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,想了解他，应该从这里开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna get to him, that's how you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.68,0:58:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在享受这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he's relishing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.65,0:58:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,此刻他才能被倾听，被学习\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an opportunity to be heard, to be studied.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.78,0:58:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过破坏他的作品来威胁他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Threaten to destroy his work.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.85,0:58:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃里克，没这些证据你怎么定我的罪啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will you get your conviction without all this evidence, Eric?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.98,0:58:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要它们也能治得了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need this shit to convict you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.82,0:58:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你，毁了它们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So go ahead. Destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.42,0:58:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会的 - 全毁了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will. - Destroy it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.66,0:58:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这救不了儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just know it will not save your son if you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.80,0:58:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了我儿子，我就杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill my son, I kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.43,0:58:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.10,0:58:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在等什么？ 我们都清楚你是什么人，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wait? We both know the sort of person you are, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.74,0:59:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闪开 - 你可以开枪打伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of here. - The sort of person.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.34,0:59:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,手无寸铁的囚犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}who guns down an unarmed suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.04,0:59:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且，为了定罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, the sort of person who plants evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.91,0:59:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不惜假造证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}in order to obtain a conviction.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.18,0:59:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这种人老婆嫌，儿子厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sort of person whose wife leaves him and whose son hates him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.08,0:59:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你的鸟嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the fuck up!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.89,0:59:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他配制好了卫星定位 - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, set up all the traces to the satellite. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.46,0:59:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,技术组到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your tech team's arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.56,0:59:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚好来得及\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.30,0:59:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好希望他们能找到信号源\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better hope they find the source of that feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.34,0:59:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃里克，有些事我还没告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something I haven't told you, Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.91,0:59:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想听你废话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done listening to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.31,0:59:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那或许我可以拿给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I can just show it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.18,0:59:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是，要我拿不太现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, unfortunately, it's going to be difficult for me to get it myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.94,0:59:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你可以让对讲机那头的同事\N{\fnArial\fs30}so perhaps you could ask the people who are listening on that walkie in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.12,0:59:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿给我，好么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they could get it for me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.82,0:59:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,棕色的桌子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brown desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.19,0:59:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面第2个抽屉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second drawer down.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.23,1:00:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能不记得那些人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may not remember all those people,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.90,1:00:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我肯定他们还没忘了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm sure they remember you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.64,1:00:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逮捕了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the arresting officer in all of their cases,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.81,1:00:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且假造了证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you were the one who planted all the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.38,1:00:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,定了他们的罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}used to obtain their convictions.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.81,1:00:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你把他们关进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the one who put them away.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.11,1:00:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子正在和一群\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son is playing a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.75,1:00:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太喜欢你的人一起做游戏呢 侦探先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a lot of people who don't like you very much, Detective.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.29,1:00:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要是发现了他的身份可就糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be a shame if they discovered who he was.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.91,1:01:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都有保险柜的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all possess the combination to the safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.88,1:01:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细想想 数字就在你们思想的后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think hard. The numbers are in the back of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.82,1:01:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样排列它们的线索位于彩虹的彼端\N{\fnArial\fs30}The clue to their order can be found over the rainbow.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.96,1:01:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗日的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.18,1:02:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛？ - 我还没想好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - I haven't decided yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.65,1:02:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道，其他人… 他们怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the others, they're scared of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.22,1:02:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.96,1:02:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.03,1:02:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以继续争斗下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can keep going at each other like we're back in the yard,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.17,1:02:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者齐心协力抓住凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we can come together and figure out who's doing this to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.14,1:02:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想干嘛就干嘛吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and the others can do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.51,1:02:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经找到了想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already found what I'm looking for.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.28,1:02:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我想起了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remind me of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.18,1:02:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么处境\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what kind of fucked-up situation you're in,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.62,1:02:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总能设法找到一个敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you always gotta find yourself an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.29,1:02:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白么？ 兄弟，我有敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I got enemies, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.12,1:02:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这些他妈的墙的外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outside these fucking walls, bro.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.13,1:02:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.43,1:02:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果找不到… 他们就会对我亲近的人下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if they don't find me, they're going after the ones closest to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.03,1:02:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.27,1:02:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.84,1:02:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.94,1:03:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.01,1:03:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我，我就喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just me, and that's the way I like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.48,1:03:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，转过身去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, turn around.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.02,1:03:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 转身\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.64,1:04:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.54,1:04:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不，我们不能停下来 - 糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. We can't stop. - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.88,1:04:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.18,1:04:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经在这2小时了 如果那带子里说的没错…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been here for two hours. If what that tape says is true,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.52,1:04:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,前门会在1小时内打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}then in one hour, the front door will open.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.19,1:04:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们坚持不了那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna make it that long.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.99,1:04:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这态度还真不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a real winning attitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.69,1:04:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knows what she's talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.06,1:04:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.62,1:04:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,「X」是标记点\N{\fnArial\fs30}"X" marks the spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.99,1:04:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.43,1:05:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,「X」标记…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"X" marks…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.60,1:05:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,标记了地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marks the spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.13,1:05:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,标记了答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.44,1:05:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和他一起干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing with him?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.61,1:05:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你父亲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your father?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.62,1:05:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么，你认识他？ - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? You know him? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.59,1:05:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他把我抓起来的 他设的局\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the guy who put me away. He set me up.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.86,1:05:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他不是你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me that's not your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.34,1:05:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的，没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.80,1:06:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在谁都不信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't trust any of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.17,1:06:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩靠自己吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are on your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.71,1:06:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们知道自己的共同点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we know what we have in common.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.78,1:06:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达，求你了，我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda, please. I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.22,1:06:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，小鬼，阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid! Amanda!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.09,1:06:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们上哪儿去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.19,1:06:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你别丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.35,1:07:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta move.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.93,1:07:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂，小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.40,1:07:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.27,1:07:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现出路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.78,1:07:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,八\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.41,1:08:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.46,1:08:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…要…跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not run.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.55,1:08:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃里克，埃里克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric. Eric.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.42,1:08:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，住手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.12,1:08:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手拿开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.53,1:08:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们试过你的方法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tried it your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.53,1:08:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,人渣，我儿子在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You motherfucker! Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.41,1:09:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.22,1:09:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.95,1:09:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能眼睁睁看儿子流血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to go now until your son is pissing blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.57,1:09:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，才是得奖的埃里克·马修\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's the Eric Matthews they gave medals to.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.96,1:10:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.10,1:10:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.33,1:10:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.10,1:10:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔纳斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.94,1:10:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.55,1:10:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.37,1:11:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.11,1:11:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.57,1:11:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救命！ - 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help me. - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.55,1:11:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.62,1:11:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.75,1:11:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.47,1:11:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.51,1:11:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.29,1:12:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,人渣，没人在听了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's listening anymore, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.06,1:12:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,张嘴，张嘴！ 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open your mouth. Open your mouth! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.53,1:12:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.80,1:12:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在想告诉我他的位置了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna tell me where he is now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.27,1:12:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.51,1:12:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.38,1:12:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game over.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.11,1:12:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就带你到房子去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take you to the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.95,1:12:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在就得带我去 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna take me right now. Right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.22,1:12:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只会带你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will only take you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.59,1:12:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one else.
