Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.89,1:26:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡的解药？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cure for death itself?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.16,1:26:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer is immortality.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.17,1:26:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daniel!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.64,1:26:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下一笔财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}By creating a legacy,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.27,1:26:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,活了值得纪念的一生 你才能永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}by living a life worth remembering, you become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.15,1:27:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们发现你坐在桌子的另一面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now you find the tables are turned.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.52,1:27:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他找的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.85,1:27:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你他妈的到底要什么？ - 我告诉过你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the fuck do you want? - I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.42,1:27:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想让我们活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants us to survive this.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.75,1:27:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想做个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.66,1:27:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要按规则来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to play by the fucking rules!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.46,1:27:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,规则很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rules are simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.69,1:27:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要做的只是… 坐在这里和我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to do is sit here and talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.49,1:27:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.56,1:27:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间到了 你会发现你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can do that long enough, you will find your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.96,1:27:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a safe and secure state.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.23,1:27:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他妈的是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.43,1:27:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你儿子丹尼 你还记得他吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your son, Daniel. You remember him, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.27,1:27:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad's a…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.37,1:27:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是好惹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a real hardass.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.50,1:27:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call you unworthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.81,1:27:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,配不上你被赋予的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the life that you've been given.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.84,1:27:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子垂死的消息…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The knowledge of your son's impending death.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.98,1:27:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,促使你原谅了他所有的过错\N{\fnArial\fs30}has caused you to forgive all his sins.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.18,1:27:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么只有在性命攸关的时候… 我们才想起这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is that we're only willing to do that when a life is at stake?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.21,1:27:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daniel!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.35,1:27:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不听你废话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done listening to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.45,1:27:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget the rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.55,1:27:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the fuck up!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.62,1:27:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在玩一个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's playing a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.69,1:27:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想和他废话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.75,1:27:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not saying shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.89,1:27:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都清楚你是哪种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both know the sort of person you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.52,1:27:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子快死了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to go now until your son is pissing…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.96,1:27:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你带到屋子里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take you to the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.76,1:27:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daniel?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.73,1:27:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃里克，有些事我没告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something I haven't told you, Eric.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.40,1:27:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰死了后，我会完成他未完成的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is I who will carry on John's work after he dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.17,1:27:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daniel!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.84,1:28:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你啊，毁了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}So go ahead. Destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.94,1:28:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.28,1:28:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daniel!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.38,1:28:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,…就是我第一个实验对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are my first test subject.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.65,1:28:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在被锁上的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you are locked away,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.95,1:28:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那么的孤独和无助\N{\fnArial\fs30}helpless and alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.39,1:28:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你他妈的婊子 - 游戏结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You fucking bitch. - Game over.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.26,1:28:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你他妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fucking kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.93,1:28:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个婊子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.53,1:28:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个婊子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.47,1:28:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你他妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fucking kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.21,1:28:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.68,1:28:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
